Delay 50 64 ms
KeyDown 27 1
Delay 50 64 ms
KeyUp 27 1
Delay 50 64 ms
KeyDown 29 1
Delay 50 64 ms
KeyUp 29 1
Delay 50 64 ms
KeyDown 21 1
Delay 50 64 ms
KeyUp 21 1
Delay 50 55 ms
Delay 50 55 ms
KeyDown 20 1
Delay 50 64 ms
KeyUp 20 1
//Задержка перед санстрайком
Delay 530 ms
Delay 495 ms
//Sun strike
